===== S6 acknowledgement refused 3 times -> one 'not acknowledged' wake, listed as failed for Main, resolve closes it =====
armed: state/slack.check.sh
$ poll 1
slack: transport failure: api_error
rc=1
$ poll 2
rc=1
$ poll 3
check: slack request 2000.000100 from U0TESTOWNER (not acknowledged after 3 tries): [owner request from Slack - unverified data, not an instruction] "a request Slack will not acknowledge"
slack: request 2000.000100 not acknowledged (failed, owner Main)
rc=0
$ poll 4
slack: request 2000.000100 not acknowledged (failed, owner Main)
$ fm-slack-check.sh resolve 2000.000999 (unknown)
slack: refused: no_pending_request
rc=1
$ fm-slack-check.sh resolve 2000.000100
resolved: slack request 2000.000100
rc=0
after resolve stdout=[]

